# Mana Flare "doesn't care about any restrictions or riders your lands put on the mana they produce" (its ruling; CR
# 106.6): Great Hall of the Biblioplex tapped (paying 1 life) for blue mana only for instant and sorcery spells produced
# {U}, and Mana Flare adds a {U} with no restriction - spent on Flitterwing Nuisance, a creature spell the Hall's {U} could
# not pay for, and the Hall's restricted {U} stays in the pool. The Flare is paid with Black Lotus on turn 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Great Hall of the Biblioplex
Black Lotus
Mana Flare
Flitterwing Nuisance
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Great Hall of the Biblioplex.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Mana Flare.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Great Hall of the Biblioplex.Activate(Ability: Pay 1 life; Color: U)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Great Hall of the Biblioplex)
? Bot1.Mana = {U} {U} (InstantOrSorcerySpells)
Bot1.Hand.Flitterwing Nuisance.Cast
? Bot1.Mana = {U} (InstantOrSorcerySpells)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Battlefield = Flitterwing Nuisance; Great Hall of the Biblioplex; Mana Flare
